Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Person1:
	.string "The sea breeze in SUNYSHORE is the\n"
	.string "best in SINNOH. Ask any sailor.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Person2:
	.string "The whole city runs on solar power.\n"
	.string "The walkways soak up the sun!$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Person3:
	.string "The market has the strangest things.\n"
	.string "I bought a sea shell that sings when\l"
	.string "you shake it.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Person4:
	.string "We're fixing up the walkways again.\n"
	.string "The sun's tough on them.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Person8:
	.string "From the lighthouse you can see the\n"
	.string "MOéMON LEAGUE on a clear day.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Person10:
	.string "I'm visiting from OLIVINE, in JOHTO. I\n"
	.string "came to see this city's lighthouse.\p"
	.string "It's beautiful. I'll tell everyone back\n"
	.string "home about it.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Sign5:
	.string "SUNYSHORE MARKET\p"
	.string "Something new every day!$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Sign6:
	.string "SUNYSHORE CITY\p"
	.string "The port city bathed in sunlight.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Sign7:
	.string "SUNYSHORE CITY MOéMON GYM\p"
	.string "LEADER: VOLKNER\p"
	.string "The shining spark!$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Sign9:
	.string "VISTA LIGHTHOUSE\p"
	.string "Guiding ships home since long ago.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Sign14:
	.string "JULIA'S HOUSE$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Sign15:
	.string "A big rock by the shore. Someone\n"
	.string "painted a smiling MOéMON on it.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCity_Text_Sign16:
	.string "This sign is blank.$"

